me candidate intermediates. However, without per-event times I cannot establish an increasing-time sequence satisfying the 600-unit constraint, so the temporal evidence is insufficient."}, "raw_final_response": "{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_b01bcb3b\",\n  \"decision\": \"insufficient\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"cascade\",\n  \"entities\": [1800, 1115],\n  \"window\": [48286, 86685],\n  \"confidence\": 0.85,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_01\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_02\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_06\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_05\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_03\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_04\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_07\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_08\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_09\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"}\n  ],\n  \"narrative\": \"I cannot confirm a time-respecting cascade because the available tool outputs provide static adjacency and aggregated event counts within the window but do not provide the timestamps of individual interactions needed to verify a temporally ordered chain with gaps <=600. The neighborhood/k-hop outputs (step_01, step_02) and the edge count (step_06) show connectivity/interaction activity, while top-activity and neighbor lists (steps_05, 03, 04) show both nodes are active and have many contacts. Targeted pair checks (steps_07\u201309) found no events for some candidate intermediates. However, without per-event times I cannot establish an increasing-time sequence satisfying the 600-unit constraint, so the temporal evidence is insufficient.\"\n}", "total_input_tokens": 54981, "total_output_tokens": 5427, "total_tokens": 60408, "total_latency_ms": 73101, "llm_calls": 10, "schema_repairs": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}